{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation COMPLETE; landing BLOCKED by a pre-existing, unrelated main-red condition.\n\nGerrit change: https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/1377 (e34a: config-drive Cloud probe resolved_statuses), Change-Id I399c2e88681c2ec6f6b0dc5dd055554da621cdda.\n\nWork done (all local gates green):\n- src/rebar/_config_schema.py: added JiraConfig.resolved_statuses: list[str] (default [\"Resolved\",\"Done\",\"Cancelled\"]) + _as_str_list coercer under _SECTIONS[\"jira\"]; REBAR_JIRA_RESOLVED_STATUSES auto-derived.\n- adapters/jira/probe.py: classify_probe_response now binds the configured set via _resolve_resolved_statuses(), falling back to module-level RESOLVED_STATUS_NAMES when unset/EMPTY/ConfigError (mirrors DC settings.py guard). DECISION comment updated.\n- docs/config.md: documented the new jira.resolved_statuses key.\n- tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/fetch/test_probe_resolved_statuses_config.py: held-out tests (7 passed).\n- make lint: PASS. make typecheck: PASS (429 files). Relevant test modules: 62 passed.\n\nHeld-out TDD + mutation evidence:\n- RED first: after adding only the config field, the two custom-set probe tests were RED for the right reason (probe ignored config -> \"Done\" stayed PRESENT_RESOLVED under a [\"Closed\",\"Complete\"] tenant). After threading config: GREEN (7 passed).\n- Mutation 1 \"return RESOLVED_STATUS_NAMES\" (ignore configured set): RED (2 custom-set tests). Restored -> GREEN.\n- Mutation 2 \"return frozenset(configured)\" (drop empty-list guard): RED (empty-list fallback test). Restored -> GREEN.\n\nBLOCKER (Verified -1, CI run 30934895074): origin/main is currently RED on the CI Module-size gate — src/rebar/_commands/transition_close.py is 803 LOC (> 800 cap). The gate scans ALL src/rebar files globally, so every open Gerrit change gets Verified -1. This is unrelated to e34a (that file is untouched by 1377) and also fails main's own \"Test Suite (mirror)\" run 30934939148. Filed as bug ce14-01c6-a26f-4096 (discovered_from e34a; e34a depends_on it). Per the no-force rule and \"don't fix unrelated pre-existing issues\", e34a's change is NOT bundled with that repair and the ticket stays in_progress until main is green and 1377 reaches Verified +1."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785865949981850001,"uuid":"61ce034b-e599-4629-9885-d3b30ae59812"}